resources.string:
While the relay is on, Mesh+:

• reads the SMS this phone receives and posts them to %1$s;
• posts the number of each incoming call to %1$s (Android calls this call log access);
• sends SMS from this phone's number when someone in %1$s asks.

Everyone in %1$s can read them. They travel only over your radio's mesh, encrypted with the room's key, never to us or any server. Turn the relay off here at any time.
